    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41633" root="وثج" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثِيجٌ</span></b>  Anything (S) <i>dense; thick; compact.</i>
(S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A horse, (S,) and a camel, (TA,)
<i>compact in flesh:</i> (S:) or <i>strong.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<i>Dense, thick,</i> or <i>compact,</i> herbage. (TA.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارض موتثجة</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوْبٌ وَثِيجٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A garment,</i>
or <i>piece of cloth, of firm texture.</i> (A.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثياب موثوجة</span>.]

